    "focal_point" : {
      "x" : 0.5,
      "y" : 0.5
    },
    "meta_data" : {
      "height" : 308,
      "width" : 1263
    }
  },
  "loyaltyText11" : "<p>Every customer who shops at Titan and partner</p><p>brands earns encircle points. NeuCoins are</p><p>rewards you earn on Tata Neu and our associated</p><p>partner brands.</p>",
  "image4" : {
    "path" : "/images/loyalty-programs-page/loyalty-image1.png",
    "focal_point" : {
      "x" : 0.5,
      "y" : 0.5
    },
    "meta_data" : {
      "height" : 120,
      "width" : 120
    }
  },
  "loyaltyText10" : "<h4>Earn NeuCoins/Encircle Points</h4>",
  "loyaltyText2" : "<p>You can redeem NeuCoins not just at Titan but on</p><p>Tata Neu and across several participating brands</p>",
  "image9" : {
    "path" : "/images/loyalty-programs-page/loyalty-image6.png",
    "focal_point" : {
      "x" : 0.5,
      "y" : 0.5
    },
    "meta_data" : {
      "height" : 120,
      "width" : 120
    }
  },
  "loyaltyText13" : "<p>You can use your NeuCoins on Tat Neu or any</p><p>of our partcipating brands. Encircle points can</p><p>be redeemed at any of the Titan and partner</p><p>brands</p>",
  "loyaltyText1" : "<p>The Encircle points are now on-board with NeuPass. Every time you spend with Titan or other brands on NeuPass, you get to earn NeuCoins.</p>",
  "loyaltyText12" : "<h4>Redeem NeuCoins/Encircle Points</h4>",
  "image7" : {
    "path" : "/images/loyalty-programs-page/loyalty-image4.png",
    "focal_point" : {
      "x" : 0.5,
